Clearance resume template: latex-medium-professional ("Medium Length Professional")
Copyright 2026 Clearance. All rights reserved.

  Template id:      latex-medium-professional
  Template version: 1.0.0
  Layout:          US Letter, 11pt, centred uppercase name, uppercase ruled section
                   headings, right-aligned dates, hyphen bullets, hanging-indent skills
  Attribution:     Clearance

Clearance template, original implementation. Inspired by the "Medium Length
Professional CV" class by Trey Hunner / LaTeXTemplates (LPPL-1.3c), but no upstream
source is copied: the document compiled at render time is generated per resume by
backend/src/render/latexExport.ts.

